Welcome to L0S on the Raspberry Pi 5. Try ls, df, ps, dmesg, lsusb, run hello.
Commands in /bin, services in /sbin, apps in /Applications, files in /Volumes/tmp.
dmesg says what each driver found: xhci and usb-hid the USB devices, hvs the screen.
run keys echoes what the USB keyboard sends, until Esc.
